"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/e2e6baaa78b601fae71cf53c61c6347e.poster.avif?t=1754556627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/e2e6baaa78b601fae71cf53c61c6347e.webm?t=1754556627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2085540/extras/e2e6baaa78b601fae71cf53c61c6347e.mp4?t=1754556627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
